{"type":"message","id":"164e1d6e","parentId":"c03dad63","timestamp":"2026-05-28T10:05:39.022Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - the /history endpoint works with POST but not with GET when using the X-API-Key header. But the /send endpoint consistently returns error code 1101 (which is a Cloudflare error). \n\nIt seems like the /send endpoint might have a bug or the platform might be having issues. The GET /history works fine (with X-API-Key header).\n\nLet me try sending without the Content-Type header or with a different approach.\n","thinkingSignature":"a12f4ae56183cc18d69de8a0fd7547463ea5c4272849053bf5e745d719c8171a"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_d9wd7ux64yjm_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with different content type / no content type\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8\" \\\n  -d \"{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"heartbeat test 10:00 UTC\\\"}\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_d9wd7ux64yjm_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check root endpoint for clues\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1010,"output":249,"cacheRead":22640,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23899,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779962731690,"responseId":"0667466cb545190e96474db643a07b89"}}
