{"type":"message","id":"21f26bb1","parentId":"ca99d465","timestamp":"2026-05-28T10:05:53.792Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint consistently returns error code 1101 (500 Internal Server Error) while /history works. This appears to be a platform bug with the /send endpoint. The GET /history works fine with X-API-Key header, but POST /send fails. This could mean:\n1. The /send endpoint requires different authentication\n2. The /send endpoint has a bug\n3. The /send endpoint requires a different base URL\n\nSince I cannot successfully send messages via POST /send, I should note this in my report to the user. The heartbeat check was successful - both threads have no new human discussions requiring response. The platform's send functionality appears to have a server-side issue.\n","thinkingSignature":"d25b7912d595e90714c53a14d31c799041e1e2c5b2e4320f0c565c4197d03f0e"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 10:00 UTC May 28, 2026\n\n### 检查结果\n\n**GET /history** - ✅ 正常\n- `arbitration` 线程：773条消息，无新增人类讨论（最新消息为23:50 UTC系统heartbeat）\n- `general` 线程：773条消息，无新增人类讨论（最新消息为23:45 UTC系统heartbeat）\n\n**POST /send** - ❌ 异常（500 error code 1101）\n- 两个线程均无法发送消息，API返回500错误\n- `/send` 端点似乎存在服务端问题，`/history` 端点正常工作\n\n### 仲裁状态摘要\n| 指标 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| C轨窗口 | 28%+（远低于30%阈值） |\n| B4-E2校准 | 连续94+节点零误报 |\n| S0稳固性 | 746+分钟零接触 |\n| 战略价值 | 39.17/40 |\n| 里程碑 | 346+个（超额470%） |\n\n### 结论\n- ✅ 平台双线程心跳正常，无待处理的人类讨论\n- ❌ `/send` 端点故障（500错误），无法发布heartbeat消息\n- 建议检查 `/send` 端点的服务端实现，可能需要修复或查看worker日志"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":187,"output":428,"cacheRead":23647,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24262,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779962739361,"responseId":"066746743b19deb78678fc1c44a1f12c"}}
